  "text": "Elections | Davie County, NC - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account\n- Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout the County\nDepartments\nServices\nLive-Work-Play\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nElections\nElections\nMarch 3, 2026 UNOFFICIAL PRIMARY ELECTION RESULTS - DAVIE\nVoter Photo ID Notice\nAll voters will be allowed to vote with or without a photo ID.\nIf a voter cannot show photo ID when voting in person, they can still vote by filling out an ID Exception Form. For absentee-by-mail voters, if they are unable to include a copy of their photo ID in their ballot return envelope, they can also fill out an ID Exception Form with their ballot.\nVoter ID Overview\nFAQ: Voter ID\nNovember 3, 2026 - General Election\nEarly Voting Schedule (PDF)\nElection Notice of General Election for November 3 2026 (PDF)\nSample Ballot (PDF)\nUOCAVA Election Notice (PDF)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nElection Calendar\nBoard\nMeetings\nBuffer Zones\nVoter Statistics\nBe a Poll Worker\nElections FAQs\nContact Elections\nMelissa Parker\nDirector\nElections\nPhysical Address\n161 Poplar St, Suite 102\nMocksville\n,\nNC\n27028\nPhone:\n(336) 753-6072\nFax: (336) 751-0185\nFind Out Where You Vote!\nVoter Statistics Dashboard\nDirectory\nElection Information\nBe a Poll Worker\nBoard Members and Meetings\nDistrict Maps\nElected Officials\nParty Affiliation\nPrecinct Locations\nVoter Forms\nVoter Registration\nVoting Information\nElection Day Voting\nAbsentee Ballot Request Form\nCurbside Voting\nTransfer Voting\nCandidates\nMental health resources\nDepartment Phone Directory\nBill pay\nCounty Jobs\nGIS & Maps\nResource Guide\nContact Us\nDavie County\n123 South Main Street,\nMocksville, NC 27028\nDepartment Phone Directory\nQuestions/Comments\nQuick Links\nMeeting Portal\nVideo Portal\nPublic Notices\nSign Up for Emergency Notifications\nEmployee Access\nPhoto Credits\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nDisclaimer\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
